<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.200" end="00:00:04.700" style="s2">Bruce and Ryan&#39;s favorite, they&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.900" end="00:00:04.700" style="s2">to love this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.700" end="00:00:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.000" end="00:00:12.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, don&#39;t look so surprised. We&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.000" end="00:00:14.300" style="s2">sleeping together since two weeks after</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.900" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">your wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.300" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">Guess the honeymoon wore off fast.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.100" end="00:00:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about Bruce? You&#39;re cheating on me</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.900" end="00:00:25.900" style="s2">right in front of our son, Ryan?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.800" end="00:00:29.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, Bruce is mine, mine and Ryan&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.900" end="00:00:29.100" style="s2">You&#39;ve just been raising him for us.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.800" end="00:00:33.500" style="s2">Sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.000" end="00:00:34.800" style="s2">you&#39;re still my little boy. I love you</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.500" end="00:00:37.000" style="s2">no matter what.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.800" end="00:00:39.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off. You&#39;re not my real mommy. I</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.000" end="00:00:39.900" style="s2">don&#39;t want you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:45.200" style="s2">This is my mommy. Go away.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.000" end="00:00:47.400" style="s2">It&#39;s our house.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.200" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;ve all been lying to me</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.400" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.900" end="00:01:00.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, get yourself some McDonald&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.600" end="00:01:00.900" style="s2">Maybe they&#39;ll let you sleep there, too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.500" end="00:01:10.800" style="s2">Keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.800" end="00:01:13.600" style="s2">Buy some soap to wash out those mouths,</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.800" end="00:01:13.600" style="s2">all three of you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.000" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">I can build a life without you, and I</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.000" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">will.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.800" end="00:01:38.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done. Those kids are LITTLE</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.800" end="00:01:40.926" style="s2">MONSTERS. I QUIT.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.906" end="00:01:40.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.200" end="00:01:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MISS EVELYN CARTER?</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.400" end="00:01:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES, THAT&#39;S ME.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.800" end="00:01:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We scared off all those mean ladies. Why</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.200" end="00:01:58.400" style="s2">do they keep coming?</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.100" end="00:02:04.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We scared her off, too. Go the ketchup</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.192" end="00:02:04.092" style="s2">and mashed potatoes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.001" end="00:02:13.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.992" end="00:02:26.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello sir. I&#39;m Evelyn Carter. I have</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.492" end="00:02:29.192" style="s2">plenty of experience taking care of</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.792" end="00:02:29.192" style="s2">children.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.592" end="00:02:34.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get my five children to sit down and eat</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.892" end="00:02:35.292" style="s2">and you can stay.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:37.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five years with that little</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.292" end="00:02:38.192" style="s2">troublemaker, I must have learned</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.092" end="00:02:39.792" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.192" end="00:02:41.192" style="s2">I can do this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.792" end="00:02:42.892" style="s2">Leave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.192" end="00:02:44.692" style="s2">A dozen or so childcare experts couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.892" end="00:02:46.792" style="s2">do it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.692" end="00:02:48.292" style="s2">How some broke no one&#39;s supposed to.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.792" end="00:02:50.692" style="s2">5 minutes, she&#39;ll run out of here</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.292" end="00:02:50.692" style="s2">crying.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.692" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">I see you sweethearts.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.492" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">Come on out. Dinner&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.992" end="00:03:18.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How How did she dodge that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.192" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">Get the mashed potatoes. Lily, keep her</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.192" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">busy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.892" end="00:03:27.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good girl. Want a bite?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.592" end="00:03:32.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.392" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.592" end="00:03:48.192" style="s2">How&#39;d she do that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.492" end="00:03:50.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Had your fun?</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.192" end="00:03:50.892" style="s2">Come on, let&#39;s eat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.094" end="00:04:15.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.294" end="00:04:15.507" style="s2">That&#39;s enough. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.692" end="00:04:22.712" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.312" end="00:04:25.332" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.894" end="00:04:35.994" style="s2">No more throwing food. You&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.594" end="00:04:38.194" style="s2">sit down and eat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.994" end="00:04:41.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t We&#39;ll be good. We&#39;ll eat. We</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.194" end="00:04:41.094" style="s2">promise.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.394" end="00:04:56.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.794" end="00:04:56.294" style="s2">wolves?</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.494" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.394" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">wolves?</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.194" end="00:05:09.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.594" end="00:05:09.494" style="s2">I can see they scare you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.994" end="00:05:15.058" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to force yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.794" end="00:05:17.078" style="s2">This job isn&#39;t for you. You can go.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.058" end="00:05:17.078" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.794" end="00:05:27.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. I didn&#39;t say I was scared.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.394" end="00:05:37.594" style="s2">Fur or no fur, you&#39;re all just babies. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.194" end="00:05:39.794" style="s2">can take care of you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.594" end="00:05:41.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve never taken to anyone like this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.794" end="00:05:43.933" style="s2">Maybe they need more than a nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.913" end="00:05:43.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.394" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this my employment contract?</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.894" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.594" end="00:06:05.895" style="s2">The children need a mother.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.294" end="00:06:07.995" style="s2">I I wife on paper.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.895" end="00:06:10.695" style="s2">Miss Evelyn Carter,</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.995" end="00:06:10.695" style="s2">please marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.895" end="00:06:17.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you each other with an hour and you</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.895" end="00:06:19.395" style="s2">want to marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.695" end="00:06:20.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just an arrangement.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.395" end="00:06:22.295" style="s2">Sign it</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.495" end="00:06:25.595" style="s2">and you can stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.295" end="00:06:25.595" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay you $20,000 a month.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.795" end="00:06:31.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m knocking about a few, buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.595" end="00:06:31.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve never had a mom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.995" end="00:06:35.395" style="s2">I just want them to have someone they</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.795" end="00:06:35.395" style="s2">can turn to.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.195" end="00:06:39.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bruce is mine. Mine and Ryan&#39;s. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.395" end="00:06:41.595" style="s2">just been raising him for us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.695" end="00:06:43.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off. You&#39;re not my real mommy. I</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.595" end="00:06:44.495" style="s2">don&#39;t want you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.295" end="00:06:46.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if they&#39;re little wolf? They</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.495" end="00:06:48.395" style="s2">need me more than Bruce ever did.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.759" end="00:06:51.495" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.395" end="00:06:51.495" style="s2">All right, we have a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.995" end="00:06:58.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your room.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.295" end="00:07:00.695" style="s2">If you need anything, ask Harris.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.895" end="00:07:01.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.695" end="00:07:03.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before you settle in, let&#39;s get a few</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.695" end="00:07:06.195" style="s2">things straight.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.695" end="00:07:07.195" style="s2">First, the children always come first.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.195" end="00:07:08.595" style="s2">Second,</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.195" end="00:07:09.495" style="s2">we won&#39;t be having sex.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.595" end="00:07:10.895" style="s2">Third,</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.495" end="00:07:13.795" style="s2">don&#39;t fall for me</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.895" end="00:07:14.995" style="s2">while this arrangement lasts.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:16.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.995" end="00:07:19.995" style="s2">I&#39;ve already been burned once.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.695" end="00:07:19.995" style="s2">I&#39;m not about to fall for my boss.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.795" end="00:07:32.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t hear anything. What are mommy</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.895" end="00:07:32.195" style="s2">and dad talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.095" end="00:07:37.595" style="s2">If we can&#39;t hear them, let&#39;s climb up</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.095" end="00:07:37.595" style="s2">and look.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.495" end="00:07:47.295" style="s2">Are you done yet? I can&#39;t hold on much</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.795" end="00:07:49.895" style="s2">longer. Just a little longer.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.295" end="00:07:52.495" style="s2">Lily&#39;s almost there. Can&#39;t we just go to</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.895" end="00:07:54.595" style="s2">bed? I&#39;m so sleepy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.495" end="00:07:56.595" style="s2">It&#39;s mommy and daddy&#39;s first time alone</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.595" end="00:07:58.995" style="s2">in a room. Don&#39;t you want to know what</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.595" end="00:08:00.495" style="s2">they&#39;re doing? Stop whining. Henry&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.995" end="00:08:04.795" style="s2">complaining.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.495" end="00:08:07.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too heavy. I can&#39;t talk.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.795" end="00:08:07.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you need something else?</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.697" end="00:08:19.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see Dad&#39;s giving Mom a ring.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.997" end="00:08:22.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hang on. I thought this was just an</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.497" end="00:08:23.597" style="s2">arrangement.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.497" end="00:08:24.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.597" end="00:08:25.997" style="s2">But you&#39;re Mrs. Blackwood now. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.697" end="00:08:29.297" style="s2">need a ring.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.997" end="00:08:29.297" style="s2">It&#39;ll help the kids feel more secure.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.297" end="00:08:33.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I guess he wants to make it look real.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.697" end="00:08:36.897" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.997" end="00:08:36.897" style="s2">I&#39;ll take good care of them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.455" end="00:08:39.475" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.297" end="00:08:49.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kiss her. Kiss her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.281" end="00:08:49.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.556" end="00:08:52.576" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.997" end="00:08:57.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.297" end="00:08:59.797" style="s2">What are you doing out here?</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.297" end="00:09:03.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were climbing on each other to peek</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.797" end="00:09:03.197" style="s2">at you kissing.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.656" end="00:09:05.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.897" end="00:09:15.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kids, it&#39;s not what you think. We</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.497" end="00:09:15.397" style="s2">weren&#39;t kissing.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.721" end="00:09:19.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.897" end="00:09:22.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.797" end="00:09:22.697" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s taking you to bed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.797" end="00:09:31.797" style="s2">Tomorrow&#39;s your first day.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.297" end="00:09:31.797" style="s2">Get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.297" end="00:09:41.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kids, breakfast time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.597" end="00:09:56.897" style="s2">Okay, little ones. Food goes in our</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.697" end="00:09:59.986" style="s2">mouths. We don&#39;t play with it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.897" end="00:10:02.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, this really doesn&#39;t taste good.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.986" end="00:10:02.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.297" end="00:10:06.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How am I going to get these little ones</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.697" end="00:10:06.197" style="s2">to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.997" end="00:10:16.898" style="s2">Who wants race Loki?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.898" end="00:10:18.998" style="s2">Turn into your little wolves and whoever</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.898" end="00:10:20.998" style="s2">finishes their food first gets</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.998" end="00:10:24.298" style="s2">strawberry cake.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:24.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m getting the biggest cake.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.877" end="00:10:29.398" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.898" end="00:10:29.398" style="s2">I&#39;m going to beat you, Loki.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.427" end="00:10:35.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.398" end="00:10:37.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready?</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.698" end="00:10:37.998" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.632" end="00:10:40.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.217" end="00:10:45.237" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.298" end="00:10:55.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.352" end="00:10:59.098" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.798" end="00:10:59.098" style="s2">What are you doing to my children?</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.798" end="00:11:06.798" style="s2">They&#39;re my children.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.698" end="00:11:08.298" style="s2">What gives you the right to treat them</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.798" end="00:11:09.898" style="s2">like pets?</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.298" end="00:11:12.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not like that.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.898" end="00:11:12.698" style="s2">Just like go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.898" end="00:11:25.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of mommy. We wanted to play.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.598" end="00:11:29.098" style="s2">You can&#39;t be mean to mommy. You got to</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.998" end="00:11:29.098" style="s2">get past us first.</p>
