<p begin="00:11:37.398" end="00:11:42.698" style="s2">could eat it all first. Look, even Owen</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.898" end="00:11:42.698" style="s2">finished his.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.798" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Harris.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.998" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">Take care of my wife and the children.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.298" end="00:12:04.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.298" end="00:12:15.899" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.498" end="00:12:16.599" style="s2">Sir, are you here the race today? I&#39;m so</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.899" end="00:12:19.499" style="s2">sorry. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.599" end="00:12:19.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.299" end="00:12:29.599" style="s2">Sit down. me put this on.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.699" end="00:12:32.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I can do it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.099" end="00:12:37.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.428" end="00:12:47.199" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.099" end="00:12:47.199" style="s2">I didn&#39;t let you explain and I hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.899" end="00:12:50.399" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.499" end="00:12:56.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you were worried about them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.399" end="00:12:56.799" style="s2">I was just trying to get them to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.299" end="00:13:02.078" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does that hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.599" end="00:13:04.098" style="s2">I&#39;ll go easier.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.078" end="00:13:04.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
