<p begin="00:13:19.764" end="00:13:26.099" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.799" end="00:13:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, we want to sleep with you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.099" end="00:13:33.399" style="s2">Mommy, we want to sleep with you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.499" end="00:13:40.699" style="s2">Mommy, Daddy, read us a story.</p>
