<p begin="00:18:57.003" end="00:19:00.403" style="s2">Mom&#39;s [snorts] here. Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.503" end="00:19:04.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
