<p begin="00:20:14.603" end="00:20:18.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, that&#39;s him. He pushed me on</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.103" end="00:20:21.803" style="s2">purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.203" end="00:20:24.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. He fell down by himself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.803" end="00:20:28.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No mom, no manners figures.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.805" end="00:20:28.705" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare lay a hand on my son.</p>
