<p begin="00:21:16.505" end="00:21:21.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. Nobody taught you any</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.305" end="00:21:21.405" style="s2">manners. Well, I&#39;ll teach you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.805" end="00:21:25.605" style="s2">You hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.505" end="00:21:29.805" style="s2">You can say whatever you want about me,</p>
